     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello All,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to configure Shiny Server Pro to authenticate users against LDAP using double bind. But I am getting an error during login &quot;<strong style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Error:</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,238,238)\"> Incorrect username or password.</span>&quot;</div><div><br></div><div>My configurations looks like this:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">auth_ldap ldap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//<a href=\"http://organisation.com:3893/CN=Users,DC=organisation,DC=com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://organisation.com:3893/CN%3DUsers,DC%3Dorganisation,DC%3Dcom&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397175873000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27hh-tcMKw1_eRA8NClv82\">organisation.com:3893/CN=Users,DC=organisation,DC=com</a> {</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  base_bind </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sAMAccountName=bindUserId&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;password&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  user_filter </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sAMAccountName={username}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>In the logs I am getting the following with no mush details</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRACE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Attempting</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> to bind LDAP user </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;sAMAccountName=<a href=\"http://user.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://user.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397175873000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RPjjZkta6iZSPOCOeJ0Zf\">user.name</a>&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">INFO</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Failed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> login attempt </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<a href=\"http://user.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://user.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397175873000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RPjjZkta6iZSPOCOeJ0Zf\">user.name</a>&#39;</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>I tried also, but still getting similar error</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">auth_ldap ldap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//<a href=\"http://organisation.com:3893/DC=organisation,DC=com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://organisation.com:3893/DC%3Dorganisation,DC%3Dcom&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397175873000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vzNh_ZhANdmsZjo4TOpkf\">organisation.com:3893/DC=organisation,DC=com</a> {</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  base_bind </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sAMAccountName=bindUserId,CN=Users,{root}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;password&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  user_filter </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sAMAccountName={username}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Any idea what might be wrong?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div>"
