nisation,DC=com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://organisation.com:3893/DC%3Dorganisation,DC%3Dcom&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792397175875000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zAaBdPZRFqFSLPmXjefli\">organisation.com:3893/DC=organisation,DC=com</a> {</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  base_bind </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sAMAccountName=bindUserId,CN=Users,{root}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;password&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  user_filter </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sAMAccountName={username}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Any idea what might be wrong?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div></blockquote></div>"
